  "body": "On some platforms the button rendered for a NotificationAction can display an icon. [This example](http://arstechnica.com/gadgets/2014/06/android-wear-review/3/) shows it on an Android phone and watch.\n\nI propose adding a simple icon attribute (like the one on [NotificationOptions](https://notifications.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-notificationoptions-icon)):\n\n```\nUSVString icon;\n```\n",
